{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/506288-a-couple-of-changeling-the-dreaming-questions","id":506288,"title":"A couple of Changeling the Dreaming questions.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-06T18:24:56-07:00","id":506288,"title":"A couple of Changeling the Dreaming questions.","content":"I'm a longtime fan of C:tD but I'll admit my well of reference isn't as deep as it could be. As such, I have a couple questions for the better-versed.<br /> <br /> Are there any Changeling Arts that deal with the manipulation of dreams in a similar manner to Phantasm in Wraith? <br /> <br /> Is it possible to use Arts (with the appropriate Realm) to effect an item made of cold iron?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T23:22:10-07:00","id":506429,"title":"","content":"The closest Art to Phantasm is Oneiromancy, from Denizens of the Dreaming, which allows basic dream-sending (as in a two-word concept that gets translated into a dream), seeing a target's dream, bringing shadows of a target's dream into reality, entering a target's dream and defining its overall nature, and turning a target into a living dream.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T06:38:22-07:00","id":506706,"title":"","content":"Marin has you covered on the Art question. It's always struck me as strange that creatures made of dream stuff native to the Dreaming have so little ability to manipulate dreams. There are some vague references in a couple of books about changelings being able to enter a mortal's dream from the Dreaming, but there's no mechanics or details about it.<br /> <br /> As for using magic on cold iron, many nockers have tried, but all have failed. There is even a story, I forget in which book, about a nocker trying to take some cold iron into the Dreaming to purge it of its banal properties. It caused massive amounts of destruction on both Earth and in the Dreaming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T08:50:25-07:00","id":509004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/506288-a-couple-of-changeling-the-dreaming-questions?p=506706#post506706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Marin has you covered on the Art question. It's always struck me as strange that creatures made of dream stuff native to the Dreaming have so little ability to manipulate dreams. There are some vague references in a couple of books about changelings being able to enter a mortal's dream from the Dreaming, but there's no mechanics or details about it.<br /> <br /> As for using magic on cold iron, many nockers have tried, but all have failed. There is even a story, I forget in which book, about a nocker trying to take some cold iron into the Dreaming to purge it of its banal properties. It caused massive amounts of destruction on both Earth and in the Dreaming.</div> </div> </div> </div>I concur. For some reason i always thought Dreamcraft let you do it, but I went back to re-read it and discovered that I was mistaken. If I can track down text for Oneiromancy that might be the solution I need.<br /> <br /> So to clarify: any and all attempts to use a Cantrip directly upon an item of cold iron will automatically fail?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T11:06:14-07:00","id":957717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/506288-a-couple-of-changeling-the-dreaming-questions?p=506706#post506706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...There are some vague references in a couple of books about changelings being able to enter a mortal's dream from the Dreaming, but there's no mechanics or details about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apologies for the necromancy, but there ARE mechanics for this (called &quot;Dream Riding&quot;) in &quot;Dreams and Nightmares&quot;, near the back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1815-joeduncan","name":"JoeDuncan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T19:34:52-07:00","id":958007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/506288-a-couple-of-changeling-the-dreaming-questions?p=506706#post506706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is even a story, I forget in which book, about a nocker trying to take some cold iron into the Dreaming to purge it of its banal properties. It caused massive amounts of destruction on both Earth and in the Dreaming.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Dreams &amp; Nightmares. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5821-neon-sidhe","name":"Neon.Sidhe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5821_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T19:50:36-07:00","id":966000,"title":"","content":"It was an Dauntain who tried to get a cold iron crowbar into the Dreaming. He succeeded, which vaporized a dozen freeholds and most of the Dreaming around Versailles. The crowbar was violently ejected from the Dreaming, and the culprit has yet to reincarnate<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}